  "category": {
    "name": "gameplay",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/21/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Révèle les Kecleon invisibles du monde ouvert.",
      "short_effect": "Permet de détecter les Kecleon invisibles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Reveals invisble Kecleon on the overworld.",
      "short_effect": "Allows spotting of invisible Kecleon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "A device by DEVON\nthat signals any\nunseeable POKéMON.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ruby-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/5/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A device by DEVON\nthat signals any\nunseeable POKéMON.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/6/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A scope that signals the presence\nof any unseeable POKéMON.\nIt is made by the DEVON CORP.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "firered-leafgreen",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/7/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "みえない　ポケモンに\nはんのうして　おとをだす\nデボンの　とくせいひん。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "보이지 않는 포켓몬에\n반응하여 소리를 내는\n데봉의 특제품.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "會對看不見的寶可夢起反應，\n並發出聲音的得文特製產品。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ce produit en série limitée de Devon émet\nun signal sonore pour signaler la présence\nde Pokémon invisibles.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein von der Devon Corporation hergestelltes Gerät,\ndas mit einem Signalton auf unsichtbare Pokémon\nreagiert.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Artilugio creado por Devon S. A. que reacciona\na la presencia de Pokémon invisibles emitiendo\nsonidos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Congegno prodotto dalla Devon che rileva\nla presenza di Pokémon nascosti emettendo\nun segnale sonoro.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A special device made by Devon Corporation that\nsignals the presence of any unseen Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "見えない　ポケモンに\n反応して　音をだす\nデボンの　特製品。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "会对看不见的宝可梦起反应，\n并发出声音的得文特制产品。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
